  <text decls="#source_1">
    <body>
      <div type="illustration" facs="#zone_picture">
        <figure><desc>A grand piano, in a ruled frame</desc></figure>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_headline">
        <head><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#i #larger">The</hi> <name type="brand"><hi rendition="#in">HEINTZMAN</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#b #i #larger">Welte-Mignon</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#larger">Reproducing Piano</hi></name></hi></head>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_text">
        <p><lb/><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#atmosphere" type="topic" resp="#claude">Let a soft breeze slip through the window . . . rest at ease in a
          <lb/>big Morris chair</seg> . . . and <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#listening" type="topic" resp="#claude">let the greatest musicians satisfy your
          <lb/>soul with beautiful sound</seg>. Through the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> a new
          <lb/>world of music is open. <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118641832">Rachmaninoff</persName>—<persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11918625X">Hofmann</persName> and hundreds
          <lb/>of other great pianists will entertain you <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#claude"><hi rendition="#i">with their own playing.</hi></seg>
          <lb/>Marvellous—<hi rendition="#i">yes</hi> . . . <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#affordability" type="topic" resp="#claude">out of your reach—<hi rendition="#i">emphatically, no!</hi></seg> Call
          <lb/>at our Music Salon . . . hear the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name> . . . and learn how
          <lb/>easily it may be yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div facs="#zone_signature">
        <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb/><hi rendition="#i">Ye Olde Firme</hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#in #larger"><orgName>Heintzman &amp; Co.</orgName></hi>
          <lb/><hi rendition="#smaller"><address><addrLine>193-197 YONGE STREET, TORONTO</addrLine></address></hi></hi></ab>
      </div>
    </body>
